    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David said, \"The house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God is to be here, and also the altar of burnt offering for Israel.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Preparations for the Temple",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So David gave orders to assemble the foreigners residing in Israel, and from among them he appointed stonecutters to prepare dressed stone for building the house of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He provided a large amount of iron to make nails for the doors of the gateways and for the fittings, and more bronze than could be weighed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also provided more cedar logs than could be counted, for the Sidonians and Tyrians had brought large numbers of them to David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David said, \"My son Solomon is young and inexperienced, and the house to be built for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "should be of great magnificence and fame and splendor in the sight of all the nations. Therefore I will make preparations for it.\" So David made extensive preparations before his death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he called for his son Solomon and charged him to build a house for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David said to Solomon: \"My son, I had it in my heart to build a house for the Name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But this word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me: 'You have shed much blood and have fought many wars. You are not to build a house for my Name, because you have shed much blood on the earth in my sight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you will have a son who will be a man of peace and rest, and I will give him rest from all his enemies on every side. His name will be Solomon,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and I will grant Israel peace and quiet during his reign.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is the one who will build a house for my Name. He will be my son, and I will be his father. And I will establish the throne of his kingdom over Israel forever.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Now, my son, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "be with you, and may you have success and build the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, as he said you would.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "May the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "give you discretion and understanding when he puts you in command over Israel, so that you may keep the law of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will have success if you are careful to observe the decrees and laws that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gave Moses for Israel. Be strong and courageous. Do not be afraid or discouraged.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I have taken great pains to provide for the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a hundred thousand talents",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of gold, a million talents",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of silver, quantities of bronze and iron too great to be weighed, and wood and stone. And you may add to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have many workers: stonecutters, masons and carpenters, as well as those skilled in every kind of work",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in gold and silver, bronze and iron—craftsmen beyond number. Now begin the work, and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "be with you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David ordered all the leaders of Israel to help his son Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to them, \"Is not the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God with you? And has he not granted you rest on every side? For he has given the inhabitants of the land into my hands, and the land is subject to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now devote your heart and soul to seeking the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.22.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God. Begin to build the sanctuary of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
